WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.540
Japanese mornings...

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.750
Japanese Mornings

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.750
Written by Rachel Muller

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.120
Sarasvati Natto

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.120
Extra Small Beans

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.120
...begin with natto.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.500
Once you take the natto out

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.500
of the refrigerator, stir it quickly.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.370
Separate the dashi stock or soy sauce, whichever

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.370
you prefer, and mustard packets, then add them in.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.200
Lightly toast the nori.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.450
Place a pickled plum on a small plate.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.120
And use seasonal ingredients in the miso soup.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.540
If it's spring, I recommend using rape blossoms.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.330
Rainbow Shogun

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.330
To

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.330
Teresa-san

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.580
ALWAYS

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:43.580
Finally, put a cooking grate over the heat.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:43.580
Once you grill the salmon to perfection,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
your perfect Japanese breakfast will be complete.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.620
Wow!

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.950
ALWAYS

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.950
MAKE

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.950
YOUR

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.950
HEART

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.950
RAINBOW

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:52.950
Good morning, Alec! Looks like we're having

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:52.950
an incredibly delicious breakfast!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.870
Good morning!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.370
There are things even you can't handle, huh, Alec?

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.000
I absolutely couldn't take the smell of just the natto...

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.160
Hey, isn't that her? The exchange student?

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.120
Oh, you're right! She's so cute!

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.450
Oh! It's Teresa-chan and Alec.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.540
Morning, Teresa-chan, Alec-chan!

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:13.120
They're already famous here.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.120
Good morning!

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.330
Whoa! Pin-senpai?!

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.790
Tada, are they the foreign transfer students

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.790
that everyone's talking about?

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.500
Yes.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:24.500
C-cup.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.370
E-cup.

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:28.950
She's got nothing on Hina.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.870
Tada-san? And Ijuin-san?

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.700
Good morning!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.540
Morning, Teresa-chan!

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.450
Hey.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.580
She certainly is a charming girl

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.580
with a rather radiant smile.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:56.660
Tada Never Falls in Love

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.080
Chotto matte kocchi muite

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.500
Finder wa itsumo kimatte

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.910
Kimi ja nai to pin to konai

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:10.080
Boku wa douka shichatta no kai?

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.410
"O-tomodachi" o toorikoshite

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.540
Surechigai no koibito-miman mo

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:19.040
Sore wa souzoushii sekai

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:23.410
Ki ga tsukeba, marude niji no you sa

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.870
Kisetsu yo tomare

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:32.950
Kimi to kiritotta jikan ga, shashin no naka de

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:38.330
Are mo kore mo sore mo dore mo kagayaiten da yo

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:44.410
Nee kimi ni, kimi ni hitotsu tsutaetokitain da

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:51.500
Mou tomaranai, kakushi kirenai, omoi ga koko ni an da yo

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:59.750
Baby, omoide to iu film no naka e kimi ga tokete shimau mae ni

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:04.500
Todoketai kotoba ga an da yo

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:10.290
"Ima kimi ni koi shiteru yo"

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:20.000
Well, She's Not Wrong

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.370
Alec-chan, Teresa-chan, see you tomorrow!

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:28.040
Wagner-san, Magritte-san.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.370
Yes? Um...

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.500
I'm Hasegawa, the class representative.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.370
Class Representative Hasegawa-san!

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.580
Have you two decided on what club you're going to join?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.620
Club? Um, no...

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.620
If you're not busy, would you like

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.620
to go on a tour right now?

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.370
We're just fine. We don't plan on joining any.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.910
Really, Alec?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.910
Yes, really, Teresa.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:56.700
But according to our school rules,

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:56.700
everyone must be in some sort of club...

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:00.540
Then, we have to join one, too!

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.200
Okay.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.660
Hasegawa-san, please show us around!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.500
All right.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:14.120
Volleyball and basketball, softball,

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:14.120
swimming, drama, art...

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.950
There are all sorts of clubs here!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.830
How about dance or band?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:25.330
Well... I came all the way to Japan,

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:25.330
so I'd like to try something new!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.500
Do you have a samurai club?!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.000
Samurai...?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.040
Excuse her.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Photo

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Contest

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Come Join the

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Photography Club!!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Photography

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.540
Club

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.290
2018 - Photography Club

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.290
Activities Application

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.290
Pin-senpai, what's our "goal" for this year?

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:43.160
Winning contest prizes, of course!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:43.160
That is our competitive photography club's goal!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.790
Got it. "Contest Prizes"...

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:51.000
Wouldn't something like

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:51.000
"bringing in more members" be better?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.330
Don't worry about that.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:59.450
If we diligently enter contests and win some prizes,

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:59.450
we'll be teeming with club applicants!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.160
Therefore!

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.660
Photography Club Plans for the Year

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.660
May:   Hibiya Park Photography Meet

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.660
Contest / Theme: "Spring"

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.660
Jul:      Contest / Theme: "Dream"

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:05.660
Sep:    Contest / Theme: "Star"

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:05.660
Feb:    Contest / Theme: "Winter"

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.660
We'll make the themes "Spring" for May,

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.660
"Dream" for July, and "Star" for September...

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.410
and snap pictures like mad!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.290
What he said, Mitsuyoshi.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.500
Right. "Spring, Dream, Star"...

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.870
"Spring," huh?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.660
Listen up, my friends.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.450
Excuse us.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:24.580
When I say "Spring," I mean nudes!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:31.500
In antiquity, life was created from Mother Sea!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:31.500
Women are a symbol of life!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.750
My friends, you, too, should feel the brilliance of life!

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.910
P..Pin-senpai?!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:41.580
The female body is art! What's wrong

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:41.580
with loving it very much?

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:42.410
Ahem!

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.330
I brought the two transfer students here on a tour...

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.290
Let's move on to the next club.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.000
Wait, wait, wait!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.080
Wow!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.750
Nice to meet you. I'm president of

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.750
the Photography Club, third-year...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.500
Hajime Sugimoto. I am very glad

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.500
to make your acquaintance.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.580
A.K.A. Pin-senpai.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:11.950
Nice to meet you, Pin-senpai-san. I'm Teresa Wagner.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.200
I'm Alexandra Magritte.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:15.450
Please sit down.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.160
JYANJYAN Magazine

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.330
What is all of this?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.330
Uh, that's...

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.950
Why, you! Who the hell do you think you

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.950
are to dare touch Hina?!

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.580
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.330
Hey!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.080
What's with you, all of a sudden?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:37.370
Uh... S-sorry, Teresa-chan. Seriously!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.700
All of those things are Pin-senpai's prized possessions.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.700
She's his favorite gravure idol, after all.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.450
His favorite "gravure idol"?

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.200
That's a "gravure idol"?

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.580
Allow me to explain.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:06.120
A gravure idol models for photo collections or

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:06.120
frontispieces of a magazine

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:10.120
and is a female idol who expresses her cute self!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:11.370
Okay!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:17.790
Among them is Hina... who represents Japan

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:17.790
and is the top of the top...

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.950
Top of the top?

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.200
Osaka    Kyoto     Wakadoshiyori   Sobayonin   Roju            Tairo

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.200
Jodai  Shoshidai

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.200
Metsuke                          Ometsuke

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:27.790
Shogun

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.660
Basically, she's the Rainbow Shogun

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.660
of the gravure idol world, huh?!

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.000
What?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.540
Well, she's not wrong, I guess.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.540
I had no idea! I'm terribly sorry!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.620
It's okay.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.750
She certainly is a rather reasonable nice girl.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:46.790
Yeah...

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.540
Well, I'm sorry for shouting all of a sudden.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.410
Welcome to our competitive photography club.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.910
Let's give these two an enthusiastic welcome!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.950
If we make these two members,

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.950
our club budget will increase,

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.290
and we might be able to raise funds

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.290
to request nude models.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.950
We can hear everything, Hajime-chan...

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:12.540
On second thought, let's go.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:12.540
This place smells really fishy.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.250
What?! You're leaving?!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.830
What lovely photos!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:23.870
Right? Those are the pictures we took. Right, Mitsuyoshi?

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:24.870
Yeah.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.080
Really?!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:29.290
These pictures, where I look super cool,

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:29.290
were taken by me!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.000
These were taken by Mitsuyoshi.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.080
They're lovely!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.620
These were taken by Pin-senpai.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:35.750
Really?

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.790
And these were taken by the Class Rep.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.040
Wow!

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.950
Uh, the Class Rep?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.370
Hasegawa-san, are you a member, too?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.660
Huh?!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.370
I was asked to join. The club would've disbanded

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.370
if there wasn't enough members.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.830
So, I had no choice but to join.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.790
I, too, had no choice but to ask you.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.200
What's with that attitude of yours?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.200
I just told them the facts.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.160
Shut up for a second will you, Hajime-chan?

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:01.950
What for?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.000
Just because.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.120
I don't understand what you mean.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.450
Do those two not get along?

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.620
It's fine if you don't understand.

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:09.620
It's fine. They're always like that.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.830
You wouldn't understand anyway, Hajime-chan.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:10.910
Okay...

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.080
This is...!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:17.830
Hey, that's...

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:18.580
Huh?

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.080
...the Shogun's secret passage!

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.750
Yeah, it's a photo from the other day.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.790
Right!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.000
Hey, Alec, I want to try taking a photo like this, too!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.000
Huh?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.620
I've mostly been getting my picture taken.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.620
Besides, this is a rare chance for me...

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.700
So, I'd like to try taking pictures!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.750
But...

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:44.370
At any rate, you have the option

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:44.370
of joining the club on a trial basis.

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.870
Joining the club on a trial basis?

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:51.540
Yeah! That's great! If you're really interested

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:51.540
in photography, then join on a trial basis!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.750
Right, Mitsuyoshi?!

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.580
Yeah.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:54.750
Pin-senpai?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:55.750
That's true.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.450
How does that sound?

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.450
Would you like to experience one day?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.370
Sure!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.750
Alec, please?!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.370
Well, I'll allow you to try it out,

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.370
so let's think carefully about it.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.160
Thanks, Alec!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:27.370
The History

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:27.370
of Cameras

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.080
The history of cameras goes all the way back.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:26.910
In the era before Christ, cameras began as

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:26.910
a dark room with a little hole in the wall.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.040
Really?!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:28.620
You're starting from there?!

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:32.700
And in 1839, France...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.700
Let's move on! Mitsuyoshi!

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.870
Uh... The things you need to remember

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.870
when handling a camera are...

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:42.620
F-stops, shutter speed, ISO speed, and white balance.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:43.750
Huh?

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.950
Isn't that too much to remember all at once?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:46.830
You think so?

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.200
Forget about the details.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.200
First, let's enjoy snapping photos like mad!

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.620
In that case, won't that event be good for them?

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.500
Yeah.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.200
We'll lend you our club cameras.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.750
Thank you very much!

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:07.410
And with that, my friends,

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:07.410
we will hold that tradition right now!

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.580
"That"?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.580
Ijuin-kun!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.250
Hello!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.160
You're a popular guy, huh, Ijuin-san?

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.080
You could tell?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.200
There is no accounting for taste.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.500
Huh? I'm not picky.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.830
Tada, call Yamashita Dog.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.000
Okay.

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.540
Senpai!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.370
Tada-senpai! You called?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.250
I did.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.250
Allow me to introduce him. He is also

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.250
a Photography Club member. He's newcomer...

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.910
Kentaro Yamashita! I'm a first-year!

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:56.870
Nice to meet you!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:57.910
Nice to meet you.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.120
Nice to meet your acquaintance.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:02.910
He always responds to Tada's finger-whistling,

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:02.910
no matter where we go.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.000
We gave him the nickname "Yamashita Dog"!

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.790
Hey, come to the club meetings before we call you over!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:13.040
Well, the weather is nice and warm today,

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:13.040
so I inadvertently took a nap in the courtyard.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.290
That was some good sleep!

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.500
He really is like a dog...

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.870
You're all such interesting people.

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.700
I don't know about "interesting"...

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.040
I'm sorry.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.910
You shouldn't be apologizing.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.790
Well, everyone's here, so let's begin...

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.000
...the If You Take a Nice Picture, You Win!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.000
Team Photography Battle!

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:34.910
If You Take a Nice Picture, You Win! Battle

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.500
Yay!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.700
What is that?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:43.870
If You Take

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:43.870
a Nice Picture,

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:43.870
You Win!

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:43.870
~Rules~

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:42.120
It's a traditional event that the Photography Club

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:42.120
holds with the intention of improving

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.000
our photographic technique and team-building.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.950
Our time limit is one hour.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.750
We split into teams of two, A and B.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:52.580
In the four 15-minute sets, the teams will alternate

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:52.580
in taking the other team's pictures.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.950
We hold an exhibition with everyone at the end.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.950
The team that took a nice photo will be the victor.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:03.040
However, blurry pictures don't count. Pictures where

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:03.040
the subject is partially in the frame don't count, either.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.540
And touching the other team is not allowed.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.450
Playing fair and square is an absolute requirement!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:10.500
Okay!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.750
Understood.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.620
And this is how the teams will be split up.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.830
Okay!

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:21.080
Here are the results:

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:21.080
Team A will be me, Yamashita, and...

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.080
Me!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.200
Team B will be Pin-senpai, Class Rep...

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.410
Ijuin, and...

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.910
Alec-san...?

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:35.750
Huh? Three against four?

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:35.750
Aren't we kind of at a disadvantage?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.790
The team with less people will take fewer photos,

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.790
but will have fewer photos taken of them.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.410
Neither one is necessarily a disadvantage.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:45.410
You're awesome, Senpai! Roger that!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:48.950
Okay, is everyone okay with beginning the game at 3:30?

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.290
Yeah. Tada's team, Team A, will go first.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.410
Okay, we're gonna run!

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:55.660
Roger!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.120
Okay, let's go!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:04.080
Team A's Photography Begins!!

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:02.830
Okay!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:03.950
Roger!

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:08.000
First, let's start by finding those hiders!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.120
Team B may not necessarily be together.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.450
Once we encounter them, we'll only have

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.450
a split second! So, get ready to take a picture!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.370
Okay!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.040
I smell Alec-san.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.200
Really?!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.250
I don't smell her.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:24.370
There she is!

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:27.330
Gotcha!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:30.290
What?!

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:39.250
Wow... How was she so quick? Is she a ninja?!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:42.120
No good. You can't tell who she is.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:44.910
That's Alec for you! She's like a female ninja.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.950
Whose side are you on?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.910
We've got five minutes left.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.580
Tada-senpai, I've got an idea. Please leave it to me.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.250
I believe Team B is probably going

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.250
to rendezvous at any minute.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.450
I see... If we ambush them at their rendezvous, then...

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:02.580
Exactly.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.000
But where?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.950
What if we decide on their rendezvous?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.250
It was in the courtyard, after all.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:12.580
This spot definitely makes it easy for them to escape

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:12.580
and difficult for us to find them.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:21.870
You'll never get tired of eating this

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:21.870
Jubei-chan Cup Yakisoba

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:21.870
Want a bite?

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:18.160
Who did this?!

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.870
Who left this rare, limited edition convenience store

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.870
exclusive Hina fan in such a place?!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.750
Cup Yakisoba

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.750
Jubei-chan

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.500
How insolent!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.200
It's me!

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.410
Crap! This was a trap?!

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.120
Ah! Hina's over there!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.250
What?! Where?!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:33.330
What?! Stop it! I don't have time for this!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.410
Where is she?! Where is Hina at?!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.410
Where is my dear Hina?!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.750
You're so dumb, Hajime-chan.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.330
All right! It's our turn now!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.910
Team B's Photography Begins!!

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:48.000
Run! Yamashita!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Right!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.370
Wait, Yamashita Dog! Where's Hina?!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:55.870
Okay, let's go! I'll avenge Pin-senpai!

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.790
Wait! President's orders!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.830
I can't wait!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.540
Photo opportunity!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.370
Crap!

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.620
I won't let you get away!

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.700
Hey! Watch it!

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.160
Sorry!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.540
Yamashita!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.250
This way!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:21.750
Senpai!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.870
Dammit!

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:36.950
What, were you able to take one?

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.080
No, they got away.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:44.830
Where are those three?

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:53.750
They're on the connecting corridor on the second floor.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:54.620
What?!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.160
Just what are you, Sis?!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.330
Let's go!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.040
Please follow me.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.200
Sweet! I'll follow you!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:07.410
What?!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.330
Crap!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.330
Alec?!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.830
There they are!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.330
You're doomed now that I've caught you here!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.040
This way!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.080
Cooking Room

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:27.620
This is bad. Go that way!

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:28.660
Okay!

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.120
All right!

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.080
We've got no way out!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.580
Gotcha!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.120
Are you serious?!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.250
No...!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.450
D-don't take my picture!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.660
Stop it!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:52.040
Miss Teresa!

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:57.540
Aw, shucks, my shoelaces came undone...

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.410
Just our luck! Let's go!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.370
Thanks, Alec!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:09.290
Sis, you don't have any shoelaces, do you?

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.950
I'm done tying them.

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:12.580
Let's go.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:14.500
Huh?! Air laces?

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.910
Round 2 of Team A's Photography Begins!!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.370
Wait for us!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.660
Let's split into two groups!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:23.950
Roger!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.200
Sis, wait for me!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.830
If we hold out, we'll win! We're going to win!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.120
R-right!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.580
Are you all right?

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.830
I-I'm fine...

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.790
Oh, no! I'll be back with something to dry you off!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.450
Hajime-chan...?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.910
I defended my camera with my life!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:58.620
You've got the wrong idea!

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:01.580
Surprise attacks are unfair! Play fair and square!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:02.120
This happened so suddenly, so i-it's not what you think!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.410
Huh? I can't take a picture.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.580
Hey, you're not supposed to take a picture. I...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.330
I was surprised, too! Okay? It's a misunderstanding!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.370
What?

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.700
It's in movie mode.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.660
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Press the switch and change the mode it's in.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:09.950
Okay.

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.450
Hey. This is our chance...

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.540
Okay, say cheese!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.620
What are you doing, Hajime-chan?

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.040
I got it!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:23.160
Gah! Dammit!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.660
I threw up a peace sign without realizing it!

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.200
Don't laugh, Nice Girl!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.160
Well, you're a bonehead, Hajime-chan.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.330
I'm a what?!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.080
Yamashita Dog, don't you laugh, either!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.200
Round 2 of Team B's Photography Begins!!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.120
Crap! Let's run!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:41.830
Yeah!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:42.660
What?!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.000
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.540
Hey! Wait!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.330
Uh... I got you a towel...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.330
Sis, you took one just now, right?

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.000
Yes.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:54.500
Yes! Victory is as good as ours, huh, Alec-?!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Photo

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Contest

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Come Join the

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Photography Club!!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Photography

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.330
Club

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:04.290
After scrupulous deliberation of the four photos

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:04.290
remaining in the final screening...

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.290
This was chosen as number one!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.160
Wow, Alec's photo!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.040
That's amazing!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.290
You did it, Sis!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.790
In the end, we, the Team B, won!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.080
Yay!

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.660
It was nothing, really...

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.200
We lost, huh, Tada-senpai?

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.040
Yeah.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.410
That's too bad.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:27.290
And so, our Photography Club's

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:27.290
battle continues every day!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.700
Hey, you're speaking like a badass, but...

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.160
I never imagined that you would get nude!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.160
This is friggin' hilarious!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:35.120
Shut up!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.870
What did you think of the Photography Club?

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.450
I really enjoyed it!

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.910
I want to get better at taking pictures!

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:49.660
Does that mean you're going to join

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:49.660
the Photography Club, Teresa-chan?

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.450
Yes!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.790
All right!

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:52.500
Good.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.450
Welcome aboard, Teresa-san!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:55.540
Thanks!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.200
Alec?

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:02.950
I said, let's make a decision after

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:02.950
thinking carefully about it!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:10.500
I'd predicted that things would turn out this way,

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:10.500
right when you said you'd try taking pictures, mind you.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.540
Then...!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.000
You leave me with no choice. I'll be joining the club, too.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.000
Yay!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:23.160
All right! Then, let's have a newcomers party for

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:23.160
Teresa-chan and Sis over at Mitsuyoshi's place!

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:23.830
Yeah.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:26.290
Huh? But you guys didn't throw a party for me!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.660
Well, I'll be leaving now.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:27.660
Who cares about you, buddy?

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:29.870
That's mean! Well, whatever.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.410
What are you talking about?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.160
Huh?

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.000
You said you had no choice in the matter, but you're

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.000
a member of the Photography Club, too, aren't you?

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:37.250
Let's go.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.500
Tada Coffee Shop

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.500
Heya, Gramps!

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.330
I'm back.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:22:01.910
Itsumademo tsuzuite yuku to, boku wa zutto omottetan da yo

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:52.700
Welcome back!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:53.580
Hello.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:54.870
Thanks for having us.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:55.950
Welcome.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.620
Ah! Alec-san, Teresa-san!

00:21:58.620 --> 00:21:59.790
Good afternoon!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.830
Good afternoon.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.290
Hiya!

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:13.330
Ano hi kimi ga kirei sugiru wake o, boku wa nani mo shiranakatta

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.540
Yamashita-senpai!

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:05.700
Hey!

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.750
Nyanko Big, I've missed ya, buddy!

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.200
Mraow!

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:19.660
Kamisama tte hito ga kimi o tsuresatte

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:21.160
Hey, Yamashita Dog, why do you tease him

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:21.160
when you know what's going to happen?

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:25.370
Ni-do to wa aenai to boku ni iu

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:22.290
Ow...

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:24.540
I'm sorry, Yamashita-senpai!

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:25.620
Grrr!

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:26.830
Are you okay?

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:31.040
Doko ni ikun da yo, boku wa nani mo dekinakatta yo

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:28.790
Yeah!

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:32.500
Nyanko Big isn't at all willing to be my friend, huh?

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:36.120
Utsukushi sugita hito yo

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:37.080
But someday, I'm definitely going to bury

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:37.080
and rub my face in your belly!

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.250
Mraow!

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:42.700
Aitakute, aitakute donna kimi demo

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:42.750
Tada-san, I sincerely appreciate it.

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:44.700
You don't need to address him so formally.

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:48.040
Negaigoto ga moshi hitotsu kanau naraba

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.950
Then, Tada-kun?

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.040
That works.

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:54.450
Imasugu ni, imasugu ni dakishimetain da yo

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.910
Same goes for you all. Please just call me Teresa.

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:54.080
Sure thing.

00:22:54.080 --> 00:22:56.040
Okay! Okay, Alec?

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:59.540
Zutto kimi no soba ni dake itakattan da

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.000
I mean, Big Sis Alec...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.910
Kokoro no naka wa namida no ame no melody

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:01.910
Alec is fine.

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:13.620
Kimi to sugoshita hibi wa wasureru nante dekinain da yo

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:10.870
Well, we welcome you two. Here's to a happy future

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:10.870
for our competitive photography club.

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:11.910
Cheers!

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:13.620
Cheers!

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:30.200
Alec, look at this! I took an incredibly cute picture!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.790
Cute? It's just a rock.

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:35.950
It's round and smooth. It looks just like

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:35.950
a daifuku rice cake, doesn't it?

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.250
Next time: Episode 3, "I Like That."

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:40.950
I Like That

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:40.950
Please look forward to it!
